   "fix": "Add the decay to the delivered package: either conjoin `(\u2200 y : \u211d \u2192 E, IsIntegralCurveOn y (fun _ w \u21a6 (-\u2207 f) (x + w)) (Ici 0) \u2192 MapsTo y (Ici 0) (closedBall 0 r) \u2192 Tendsto y atTop (\ud835\udcdd 0))` under the same `\u2203 r > 0`, or export a companion `IsNondegenerateCriticalPoint` lemma in this file. The proof context already has every hypothesis of `ContinuousLinearMap.tendsto_of_isIntegralCurveOn_mapsTo_closedBall` plus `hfield`, so it is a few lines.",
